# Machine profile: troodon-jake (hostnames troodon*, a3dptr300*).
# Services enabled at first boot — one per line, each must exist as
# /opt/a3dp/services/<name>/ with a <name>.service unit.
# Base printer stack (klipper/moonraker/nginx/crowsnest) is base-image;
# nothing extra shipped: KlipperScreen + moonraker-obico install at
# migration time (see runbook — neither is packaged as an image service).
